Build

# Content: version only what we author (via LFS, see .gitattributes). Marketplace
# packs and course art (~12 GB) are backed up separately, not versioned.
# The pattern ignores what's INSIDE Content rather than Content itself - git can't
# re-include a path whose parent directory is ignored.
/Content/*
!/Content/Blueprints/
!/Content/Maps/
!/Content/DesertCanyon/
# World Partition one-file-per-actor data for our maps; DesertCity is not ours to keep
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/
!/Content/__ExternalObjects__/
/Content/__ExternalActors__/DesertCity/
/Content/__ExternalObjects__/DesertCity/

**/BlackAlder
**/Landscape
**/MedievalDungeon
**/Megascans
**/StarterContent
**/Assets

# Third-party marketplace plugins (installed per machine, not our source)
Plugins/Marketplace/

# Doc screenshots - keep the markdown, not the multi-MB captures
Docs/Images/

.vscode
.vs
.idea
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.sln
*.slnx
